WEBVTT

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:52.458
<i>Captain Sakaki, please respond.</i>
<i>We should be able to communicate.</i>

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:56.083
My demands are to leave
Planet Tau-e immediately,

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:58.542
and abandon the emigration project.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.792
Until I hear from the captain,
I'm not moving from here.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:05.958
<i>The Tau-e emigration decision was made</i>
<i>by the Central Committee.</i>

00:01:06.042 --> 00:01:10.125
<i>Your interference will be classified</i>
<i>as a first-degree crime.</i>

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:12.875
People will not survive on that planet!

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:16.792
If I'm a criminal,
then the Committee members are murderers!

00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:17.833
<i>Look at this.</i>

00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:21.542
<i>The emigration list is made up</i>
<i>of volunteers.</i>

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:23.042
<i>Why do you interfere?</i>

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:23.958
Shut up!

00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:28.917
<i>You gathered old men and women,</i>
<i>coerced them, and call that volunteering?</i>

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.958
<i>You're going to kill them!</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.208
<i>All you want to do</i>
<i>is reduce the mouths to feed!</i>

00:01:34.292 --> 00:01:35.875
<i>Watch your words, Captain!</i>

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:39.375
We're communicating
through an open channel.

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:42.083
Everyone on this ship can hear us, right?

00:01:42.542 --> 00:01:46.792
<i>Right now, this ship is trying</i>
<i>to abandon the elderly people.</i>

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.792
<i>We may be low on resources.</i>

00:01:49.292 --> 00:01:51.125
<i>But can this be forgiven?</i>

00:01:52.042 --> 00:01:55.625
<i>Weren't we looking for the promised land</i>
<i>that would save us?</i>

00:01:55.833 --> 00:02:00.125
<i>Can you really abandon the weak</i>
<i>and continue to hold your head up high?</i>

00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:01.125
Captain Sakaki.

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:04.042
<i>I'll wait one hour.</i>

00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:08.875
<i>If this ship doesn't change course,</i>
<i>I will blow up this shuttle.</i>

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:10.917
<i>I'm not bluffing!</i>

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:20.292
<i>Please stop already, Captain Sakaki.</i>

00:02:21.417 --> 00:02:25.375
<i>It's true that we, the volunteers,</i>
<i>really do want to go to Tau-e.</i>

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:28.958
<i>We're not being chased out or anything.</i>

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.458
Don't be foolish! This is suicide!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:36.625
<i>We've been on this ship for over 20 years</i>
<i>while wandering through space.</i>

00:02:37.208 --> 00:02:39.708
<i>The young people may be able</i>
<i>to endure this.</i>

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.542
<i>But for us, we're at our limit.</i>

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:48.292
But... if you give up, then...

00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:49.542
<i>Haruo.</i>

00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:52.250
-...then it's all over!
<i>-Haruo!</i>

00:02:53.417 --> 00:02:54.542
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:02:56.167 --> 00:02:59.208
<i>At least, when I die,</i>
<i>I'd like to be standing on land.</i>

00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:03.583
<i>It could be on any planet.</i>

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.417
Grandpa.

00:04:35.792 --> 00:04:41.125
PLANET OF THE MONSTERS

00:04:47.208 --> 00:04:50.500
<i>It began in the last summer</i>
<i>of the 20th Century.</i>

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:55.375
<i>Look at that! It's a monster!</i>
<i>This is an unbelievable scene.</i>

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.708
<i>For the first time...</i>

00:04:58.292 --> 00:05:02.917
<i>humanity realized they weren't the rulers</i>
<i>of this planet anymore.</i>

00:05:05.708 --> 00:05:06.542
<i>Monsters.</i>

00:05:08.083 --> 00:05:14.000
<i>From the depths of the earth and sea,</i>
<i>or even from a forgotten divine myth,</i>

00:05:14.625 --> 00:05:16.708
<i>they kept appearing, relentlessly.</i>

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:21.125
<i>In order to bring an end</i>
<i>to humanity's prosperity.</i>

00:05:21.375 --> 00:05:24.125
<i>The UN Countermeasure HQ</i>
<i>has named it "Godzilla."</i>

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.208
<i>And then, in the end,</i>
<i>our worst nightmare appeared.</i>

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:30.208
<i>Godzilla.</i>

00:05:31.792 --> 00:05:34.958
<i>Human or monster,</i>
<i>it burned everything in sight.</i>

00:05:35.958 --> 00:05:37.542
<i>The avatar of destruction.</i>

00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:42.792
<i>At 2:30 EST, a large-scale nuclear attack</i>
<i>was launched against Godzilla, but failed.</i>

00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:48.708
<i>At midnight, the EC Allied Forces</i>
<i>announced they have begun evacuations...</i>

00:05:48.792 --> 00:05:51.500
<i>The earth collapsed</i>
<i>and the skies rained fire.</i>

00:05:52.917 --> 00:05:58.417
<i>And then, it was not only Earth's humans</i>
<i>who feared its destructive power.</i>

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.750
<i>Above the UN building,</i>
<i>mysterious flying objects--</i>

00:06:01.875 --> 00:06:05.250
<i>People of Earth, we are the Exif.</i>

00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:08.125
<i>We are observers and predictors.</i>

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:11.042
<i>We have come to tell you of your destiny.</i>

00:06:11.542 --> 00:06:15.792
<i>The time of destruction is nigh.</i>
<i>You must discover a path to devotion.</i>

00:06:17.542 --> 00:06:18.875
<i>We are the Bilusaludo.</i>

00:06:19.542 --> 00:06:23.167
<i>Our home planet, the third planet</i>
<i>in the Bilusaludia Binary System,</i>

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.500
<i>was swallowed by an accursed black hole</i>
<i>and destroyed.</i>

00:06:26.792 --> 00:06:30.458
<i>We are requesting immigration</i>
<i>to this solar system's third planet.</i>

00:06:30.542 --> 00:06:37.500
<i>If you accept, we promise to eradicate</i>
<i>your greatest threat, Godzilla.</i>

00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:42.417
<i>Those from a far away galaxy, who were</i>
<i>after this blue planet for themselves,</i>

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.625
<i>didn't wait for this paradise of oxygen</i>
<i>and water to become scorched earth.</i>

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.875
<i>-Godzilla has passed the defense line!</i>
<i>-The walls will give us some time.</i>

00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:53.792
<i>A3 and A5 blocks' AIs are silent!</i>

00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:57.083
<i>-Mecha-Godzilla won't activate!</i>
<i>-Why won't it activate?</i>

00:06:57.167 --> 00:06:59.542
<i>Atomic breath detected! Incoming!</i>

00:07:00.542 --> 00:07:03.125
<i>The fourth armored wall is gone!</i>
<i>It's over!</i>

00:07:03.208 --> 00:07:04.750
<i>We have no choice. Evacuate!</i>

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:06.417
<i>All units, evacuate! Hurry!</i>

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:10.167
<i>Wait! If we can activate Mecha-Godzilla,</i>
<i>we can defeat it!</i>

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:11.667
<i>We're leaving, Galu-gu!</i>

00:07:11.875 --> 00:07:15.250
<i>However, even with the humanoids'</i>
<i>gathered intelligence,</i>

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:19.167
<i>the destroyer's powers</i>
<i>overwhelmed us completely.</i>

00:07:33.667 --> 00:07:34.875
Where's Mom and Dad?

00:07:35.542 --> 00:07:38.208
They'll catch up soon.
See? That's the bus.

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:40.708
Hey, what's that?

00:07:43.208 --> 00:07:44.125
It's Godzilla!

00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:45.792
Godzilla's here!

00:08:01.375 --> 00:08:02.417
Haruo! Hurry up!

00:08:31.792 --> 00:08:34.917
<i>I remember the flames that burned the sky,</i>

00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:38.375
<i>and the sunken, despaired faces</i>
<i>of the adults.</i>

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:47.083
<i>We departed hoping to find</i>
<i>another inhabitable planet.</i>

00:08:48.917 --> 00:08:53.875
<i>However, we would soon pay the price</i>
<i>for such foolish optimism.</i>

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.708
<i>In the frozen, black space,</i>

00:09:01.625 --> 00:09:05.500
<i>this was a kind of hell</i>
<i>worse than our planet destroyed in flames.</i>

00:09:11.292 --> 00:09:15.292
<i>There were endless days of suffering</i>
<i>from hunger, thirst, and cold.</i>

00:09:17.792 --> 00:09:19.250
<i>Some fell to disease.</i>

00:09:20.292 --> 00:09:22.875
<i>And others gradually lost their sanity.</i>

00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:28.750
<i>Our brethren's numbers plummeted</i>
<i>in the blink of an eye.</i>

00:09:32.417 --> 00:09:37.375
<i>Even those still living had no time</i>
<i>to mourn the dead.</i>

00:09:39.292 --> 00:09:43.125
<i>Kindness and pride are now</i>
<i>long-gone stories of the past.</i>

00:09:48.417 --> 00:09:54.708
<i>A fairy tale from the time we each had</i>
<i>unlimited access to water and oxygen.</i>

00:09:57.042 --> 00:10:00.083
<i>Where are we going... and for what reason?</i>

00:10:02.042 --> 00:10:06.208
<i>Must we endure the misery</i>
<i>of having prolonged our lives</i>

00:10:06.917 --> 00:10:08.708
<i>by sacrificing others?</i>

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.083
<i>Why are we alive?</i>

00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:14.667
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.667
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:33.958
Were you having a nightmare?

00:10:35.042 --> 00:10:37.125
So, you're here, Metphies.

00:10:38.458 --> 00:10:42.333
It's also my job to listen
to a prisoner's confession.

00:10:42.792 --> 00:10:44.750
So I should repent to your god?

00:10:46.083 --> 00:10:48.208
I'd settle for a fake confession, too.

00:10:52.167 --> 00:10:53.875
Here's the data you asked for.

00:10:54.542 --> 00:10:55.375
Thank you.

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.167
You have quite the persistence.

00:10:59.542 --> 00:11:01.708
I don't have anything else to do.

00:11:01.875 --> 00:11:05.125
Won't you get in trouble
if they find out you're helping?

00:11:05.833 --> 00:11:08.125
I have an interest in your enthusiasm.

00:11:08.958 --> 00:11:12.208
Why are you so curious
about digging up forbidden data

00:11:12.292 --> 00:11:15.500
that anyone would otherwise
wish to forget exists?

00:11:16.333 --> 00:11:17.958
"Why," you ask?

00:11:19.917 --> 00:11:21.708
I've also been thinking "why."

00:11:22.167 --> 00:11:27.417
Ever since I was thrown in here,
that word won't get out of my head.

00:11:28.583 --> 00:11:30.667
Why have we become so miserable?

00:11:31.458 --> 00:11:34.833
Was it inevitable? A justified punishment?

00:11:36.042 --> 00:11:36.958
No.

00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:41.667
The reason we're suffering
is because we lost to that bastard.

00:11:42.167 --> 00:11:45.042
We didn't fight to the end,
but gave up and ran away.

00:11:46.875 --> 00:11:48.208
Everything is destiny.

00:11:49.417 --> 00:11:54.083
We humanoids had no way
of fighting that monster.

00:11:55.708 --> 00:11:56.750
I disagree.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.833
And I'll show them.

00:12:04.792 --> 00:12:07.375
We just needed the right strategy
and planning,

00:12:07.458 --> 00:12:09.542
and humanity could have defeated it.

00:12:10.875 --> 00:12:12.125
I'll prove it.

00:12:13.625 --> 00:12:15.208
It's a strange thing.

00:12:16.542 --> 00:12:22.333
Unlike the young ones, your generation
experienced the calamity firsthand.

00:12:25.083 --> 00:12:29.875
And yet, it's as if
you want to see that creature again.

00:12:36.542 --> 00:12:40.125
Based on the Gematron calculation,
the predictions look disappointing.

00:12:40.833 --> 00:12:46.792
The possibility of finding
a habitable planet in 20 years is 0.1%.

00:12:47.167 --> 00:12:51.125
If we want better results than Tau-e,
the outlook is even grimmer.

00:12:51.458 --> 00:12:53.500
The lack of resources is severe.

00:12:54.375 --> 00:12:59.083
Even doubling the discomfort index,
life will be unsustainable in eight years.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:04.292
The landing ship explosion the other day
was a significant psychological blow.

00:13:04.375 --> 00:13:06.292
-This is getting...
-Indeed.

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:10.042
We need to examine scenario number three
in a realistic way.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:15.500
Returning to Earth.
It's already 11.9 light years away.

00:13:16.167 --> 00:13:19.417
There's no precedent for traveling so far.
It's too risky.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:23.333
Gematron's guidance isn't bound
by time or distance.

00:13:23.458 --> 00:13:27.583
As long as the nuclear reactor
has sufficient energy, travel is possible.

00:13:27.667 --> 00:13:32.167
According to the ship's simulator,
it requires 170% of its operation ratio.

00:13:32.375 --> 00:13:34.958
I don't know if we can mobilize
the manpower.

00:13:35.167 --> 00:13:39.083
Would it be a constructive decision
to abandon the emigration?

00:13:39.167 --> 00:13:40.458
That's the problem.

00:13:41.083 --> 00:13:44.042
If we return to Earth,
would we be able to survive?

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:49.958
It is currently impossible to calculate
how much time has passed on Earth.

00:13:50.042 --> 00:13:52.292
At the very least, a few thousand years.

00:13:52.708 --> 00:13:57.083
Since we fled Earth,
the environment should have calmed down.

00:13:57.167 --> 00:13:59.667
It's possible it could've gotten worse.

00:14:02.625 --> 00:14:06.625
The problem is that strange thesis
published on the shared server.

00:14:07.292 --> 00:14:10.875
Why would that research thesis appear
at a time like this?

00:14:11.583 --> 00:14:13.417
The writer remains anonymous,

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:18.458
but it contains information that requires
special log-in credentials to access.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:23.958
The author aside, there's probably
an informant in the Central Committee.

00:14:24.042 --> 00:14:25.292
R-Ridiculous!

00:14:29.292 --> 00:14:32.292
There's an electromagnetic shield
under the body's surface?

00:14:32.375 --> 00:14:33.917
It's not a normal organism?

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.292
No, its whole body is like a giant coil.

00:14:38.042 --> 00:14:38.958
Is that true?

00:14:39.417 --> 00:14:41.208
So, what happened in the end?

00:14:41.292 --> 00:14:42.583
It's kind of weird.

00:14:42.958 --> 00:14:47.083
A new Gematron code is using 80%
of the calculation server's power.

00:14:47.167 --> 00:14:48.250
Eighty percent?

00:14:48.333 --> 00:14:50.625
Isn't it the analysis for predictions?

00:14:50.708 --> 00:14:53.083
Still, for a simulation, it's too much.

00:14:54.208 --> 00:14:57.292
So, the rumor
of returning to Earth is true?

00:14:57.917 --> 00:15:00.292
It's 11.9 light years in one go.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.625
Is a subspace jump-warp even possible?

00:15:02.708 --> 00:15:05.542
It's not a problem
if we use Gematron calculation.

00:15:05.625 --> 00:15:07.750
I heard it directly from Navigation.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:09.917
Gematron, huh?

00:15:10.208 --> 00:15:12.833
The ship leaders turn to the gods,
as usual.

00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:18.375
Maybe even that new anti-Godzilla tactic
was a leak from the higher-ups?

00:15:18.667 --> 00:15:21.167
Man, are we going to fight it again?

00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:26.042
It's a monster that withstood an attack
of 150 nuclear warheads at once.

00:15:26.125 --> 00:15:28.375
That's 40 megatons of nucleoplasm total.

00:15:28.708 --> 00:15:32.833
But the thesis contained new strategies
on how to fight it.

00:15:32.917 --> 00:15:33.750
Huh?

00:15:46.458 --> 00:15:47.333
It's me.

00:15:47.833 --> 00:15:48.833
Hey, come in.

00:15:51.542 --> 00:15:55.833
So, the Central Committee is leaning
towards going to Earth, huh?

00:15:56.458 --> 00:15:57.458
Not entirely.

00:15:58.083 --> 00:16:01.042
To give up searching
for a habitable planet

00:16:01.125 --> 00:16:03.917
means someone has to bear
that responsibility.

00:16:04.333 --> 00:16:09.417
If they're so weak they give up drifting
after only 20 years, it can't be helped.

00:16:10.125 --> 00:16:11.958
Well, I do sympathize.

00:16:12.667 --> 00:16:17.417
They haven't dealt with the loss
of their home planet as long as we have.

00:16:18.042 --> 00:16:20.958
And then, there's your practical joke.

00:16:21.667 --> 00:16:23.875
Obviously, it's a headache for Mori.

00:16:24.708 --> 00:16:28.000
I uploaded a new version this morning.
Did you read it?

00:16:28.583 --> 00:16:33.083
Yeah. When I downloaded it,
it already had over 400 views.

00:16:33.333 --> 00:16:36.167
Though the file was deleted
three seconds later.

00:16:36.917 --> 00:16:39.833
Our delinquent captain sure is popular.

00:16:40.542 --> 00:16:44.917
When there's rumor of returning to Earth,
we get more talk of Godzilla.

00:16:45.042 --> 00:16:47.958
It's effective for ridiculing
the Central Committee.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.417
Haruo is unaware of
the Central Committee's expectations.

00:16:52.583 --> 00:16:56.042
He was researching Godzilla
purely for personal interest.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:01.500
But this thesis has content that will
support our plan to return to Earth.

00:17:02.583 --> 00:17:06.208
Its claim is that
Godzilla can be defeated by human hands.

00:17:06.708 --> 00:17:10.833
If you can't understand its contents,
it just sounds like crazy prattling.

00:17:11.083 --> 00:17:14.333
Earthlings harbor that much fear
of Godzilla.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:18.208
So, do you think
it's just crazy prattling?

00:17:19.125 --> 00:17:20.583
This analysis report?

00:17:21.208 --> 00:17:23.708
No, it's actually quite interesting.

00:17:24.625 --> 00:17:27.000
So much so, I think better of him.

00:17:27.542 --> 00:17:29.417
Godzilla is not invincible.

00:17:29.792 --> 00:17:33.083
It's humanity's fault for giving up
on the fight.

00:17:33.667 --> 00:17:35.208
That's what Haruo thinks.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:42.958
He analyzed that old data because
of you Exifs' Gematron calculation.

00:17:43.458 --> 00:17:46.250
It was impossible for Earthlings
at the time.

00:17:46.458 --> 00:17:49.958
Are you saying that, if the weak-point
analysis had been made in time,

00:17:50.083 --> 00:17:52.458
that humanity
still wouldn't have been victorious?

00:17:54.333 --> 00:17:56.375
And if they did defeat Godzilla,

00:17:57.083 --> 00:18:02.333
then it was only a matter of time
until Exif's cult took over Earth.

00:18:02.833 --> 00:18:06.583
Even if Bilusaludo's Mecha-Godzilla
had defeated Godzilla,

00:18:06.667 --> 00:18:09.958
no one knows
who it would have bared its fangs at next.

00:18:14.167 --> 00:18:17.583
However, we failed in the construction
of Mecha-Godzilla.

00:18:17.667 --> 00:18:21.083
And you couldn't brainwash Earthlings
with your religion.

00:18:21.292 --> 00:18:22.750
That's history now.

00:18:23.667 --> 00:18:26.208
The what-ifs are only fairy tales.

00:18:33.292 --> 00:18:36.250
Subspace jump-warp procedure,
now entering phase two.

00:18:36.333 --> 00:18:38.500
Activating shields for all ship sections.

00:18:38.583 --> 00:18:40.917
Bypassing electricity
for the gravitational coil engine.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.250
Initiating Gematron calculation
and gravitational coils controller.

00:18:44.458 --> 00:18:48.208
Begin cluster connections with Gematron
calculation crystal and central AI.

00:18:48.375 --> 00:18:51.708
Gravitational coil engine
for all sections functioning normally.

00:18:51.792 --> 00:18:53.000
Preparations for spin complete.

00:18:53.083 --> 00:18:57.167
Subspace coordinate system render
will be displayed on the central hologram.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.000
Attention all personnel.

00:18:59.208 --> 00:19:02.750
This ship, Aratrum,
will soon initiate subspace jump-warp.

00:19:03.417 --> 00:19:07.250
<i>Estimated emergence coordinates are near</i>
<i>the solar system's third planet, Earth.</i>

00:19:07.333 --> 00:19:11.167
<i>Based on the ship's time,</i>
<i>22 years have passed since our departure.</i>

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.667
<i>This subspace jump-warp</i>
<i>will be the longest we've traversed.</i>

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.292
Finally. The real Earth!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.875
I wonder if we can see the ocean?

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:22.500
That'd be awesome if we can!

00:19:22.792 --> 00:19:26.125
The longest? Is this really safe?

00:19:26.208 --> 00:19:29.792
<i>...no idea what changes</i>
<i>Earth's environment has undergone.</i>

00:19:29.875 --> 00:19:31.042
<i>After an investigation,</i>

00:19:31.125 --> 00:19:35.750
<i>if we conclude the environment</i>
<i>has become unfit for human survival,</i>

00:19:35.833 --> 00:19:37.458
<i>we will collect resources...</i>

00:19:37.833 --> 00:19:40.833
Hey, is the real Earth
prettier than the hologram?

00:19:40.917 --> 00:19:42.708
Yes, it is.

00:19:43.958 --> 00:19:47.750
Entering Gematron-predicted coordinates.
Suspending main propulsion drive.

00:19:48.042 --> 00:19:50.375
We now have all the Gematron numbers.

00:19:50.458 --> 00:19:53.583
Irrational numbers converted to integers.
Computing time-space recon point.

00:19:53.833 --> 00:19:57.667
Chances of a wormhole appearing is 440%
in a simulated observation.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.167
Releasing gravitational coil output
for each section of the ship.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.125
Maximum spin.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.042
Captain, on your order.

00:20:11.833 --> 00:20:13.000
Initiate jump-warp.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.375
Jump-warp initiated. Commence shift
into phase one space travel.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.583
Gravitational coil at max speed,
running stable.

00:20:41.792 --> 00:20:44.375
Arriving at launch point
required for final trajectory.

00:20:47.125 --> 00:20:49.000
Breaking through subspace.

00:21:14.417 --> 00:21:15.333
Amazing.

00:21:16.125 --> 00:21:17.875
Hey, it's really blue!

00:21:17.958 --> 00:21:20.083
-That's the ocean?
-It's beautiful.

00:21:20.708 --> 00:21:21.667
That's Earth?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.417
Yes, that's right.

00:21:23.583 --> 00:21:24.958
It really is blue!

00:21:25.042 --> 00:21:28.000
To think that I'd see it again.

00:21:28.625 --> 00:21:32.375
Disabling shields in all sections.
Normal travel mode stable.

00:21:32.833 --> 00:21:35.167
Distance from Earth, 1,800 kilometers.

00:21:35.542 --> 00:21:38.125
Recalculating low orbit entrance errors.

00:21:45.167 --> 00:21:47.958
Our Earth that was taken from us.

00:21:51.125 --> 00:21:52.500
Orbit errors corrected.

00:21:52.583 --> 00:21:54.500
Now entering low Earth orbit.

00:21:55.208 --> 00:21:58.750
If we can't land on Earth,
we'll have a revolt on our hands.

00:21:59.292 --> 00:22:01.333
It's too soon to be pessimistic.

00:22:01.667 --> 00:22:04.250
Let's just wait for the scouting report.

00:22:04.583 --> 00:22:06.750
Unmanned recon drones
launching in sequence.

00:22:11.792 --> 00:22:14.208
All drone feedback systems are stable.

00:22:14.583 --> 00:22:17.542
Begin dispersion to specified areas
for surveillance.

00:22:21.417 --> 00:22:24.625
Entering the stratosphere.
Drone temperature stable.

00:22:26.042 --> 00:22:28.750
Altitude 30,000 meters, beginning descent.

00:22:30.292 --> 00:22:33.625
Altitude 15,000 meters,
entering the troposphere.

00:22:34.792 --> 00:22:36.792
Stellar observation parallax calculated.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:40.125
Elapsed time for the solar system
is approximately 10,000 years.

00:22:40.708 --> 00:22:42.667
It's been 10,000 years? That long?

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:44.375
It's more than I imagined.

00:22:44.542 --> 00:22:46.167
This could be good news.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:49.542
With that much time,
the ecosystem must have changed.

00:22:49.625 --> 00:22:50.667
Not even Godzilla...

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:51.875
I wonder.

00:22:52.417 --> 00:22:54.542
It's possible it could've multiplied.

00:22:54.625 --> 00:22:57.500
That thing is a genetic aberration.
It's impossible!

00:22:58.083 --> 00:23:01.708
Recon drones are at a scouting altitude
of 2,000 meters.

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:03.083
Receiving visuals.

00:23:04.375 --> 00:23:06.792
Drone six displaying sound signal monitor.

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:10.250
Just the sound of the wind?

00:23:10.333 --> 00:23:13.625
We can't see anything.
Can you lower the altitude?

00:23:13.708 --> 00:23:15.000
All drones descending.

00:23:15.958 --> 00:23:18.917
There are thick particles floating
in the atmosphere.

00:23:19.542 --> 00:23:21.625
Average visibility less than 300 meters.

00:23:22.667 --> 00:23:25.458
This is...
Picking up electromagnetic interference.

00:23:25.792 --> 00:23:27.417
This isn't just a normal fog.

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:29.792
Switching drones to sensor monitors.

00:23:33.083 --> 00:23:35.208
Each drone's altitude at 500 meters.

00:23:35.292 --> 00:23:37.208
Atmospheric density is increasing.

00:23:37.292 --> 00:23:39.917
Further descent by remote is impossible.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.042
Is this a forest?

00:23:42.833 --> 00:23:44.917
Or some kind of complicated terrain.

00:23:45.375 --> 00:23:47.250
Can you increase the scan power?

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:50.625
Its reflection is diffused,
so this is the limit.

00:23:52.708 --> 00:23:53.542
What's that?

00:23:54.417 --> 00:23:55.333
It's moving.

00:23:55.583 --> 00:23:58.375
Drone six,
switching to sound wave reconnaissance.

00:23:59.292 --> 00:24:02.125
Temperature around drone six
is increasing drastically!

00:24:03.208 --> 00:24:04.792
-What?
-What's happening?

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:13.958
Drone six, lost!

00:24:14.500 --> 00:24:18.667
Estimated energy output around drone six
approximately 180 gigawatts.

00:24:19.333 --> 00:24:22.500
High probability of high-energy
electron particles, or atomic breath!

00:24:27.042 --> 00:24:29.417
M-Maybe it was thunder or--

00:24:29.500 --> 00:24:32.833
Idiot! No one would ever forget that roar!

00:24:34.583 --> 00:24:38.583
Damn it. It's still on this planet.

00:24:46.625 --> 00:24:48.250
You're there, aren't you?

00:24:49.958 --> 00:24:51.625
You're still there!

00:24:57.167 --> 00:25:01.292
If the characteristics match this closely,
then that was Godzilla,

00:25:01.375 --> 00:25:04.875
or a threat similar to it,
and it must be eliminated.

00:25:05.750 --> 00:25:11.042
Our one advantage is that it acts
independently rather than in a pack.

00:25:11.292 --> 00:25:13.417
How can you say that for sure?

00:25:13.750 --> 00:25:15.458
The concentration of radiation.

00:25:16.542 --> 00:25:21.958
As you're aware, Godzilla is a creature
that scatters heavy radiation in its wake.

00:25:22.583 --> 00:25:26.458
However, even though the terrain
has undergone change,

00:25:26.542 --> 00:25:30.167
the toxins present in the atmosphere
are maintaining stable numbers.

00:25:30.250 --> 00:25:34.167
If we reverse calculate the emission data
gathered in the past three days,

00:25:34.708 --> 00:25:38.000
multiple Godzillas seem unlikely.

00:25:38.958 --> 00:25:42.250
Even now,
Godzilla is a unique genetic defect

00:25:42.792 --> 00:25:46.917
and cannot be considered
a normal living creature, is what I mean.

00:25:47.500 --> 00:25:51.250
However, it's been 10,000 years.
How can it still be alive?

00:25:52.042 --> 00:25:55.417
There are cases where lotus seeds survived
for 2,000 years.

00:25:55.667 --> 00:26:00.167
It also may be repeating cycles
of dormancy every few thousand years.

00:26:00.417 --> 00:26:03.125
Or, over 10,000 years,
it could have multiplied

00:26:03.417 --> 00:26:07.333
and diminished in number,
with this being the last surviving one.

00:26:08.042 --> 00:26:13.042
Godzilla's biology is beyond
every known aspect of life science.

00:26:13.375 --> 00:26:17.333
And we can't ignore the possibility
that it could be immortal.

00:26:17.625 --> 00:26:21.083
Studies and research
aren't this meeting's main subject.

00:26:21.583 --> 00:26:24.792
We humanoids cannot coexist with Godzilla.

00:26:25.625 --> 00:26:29.500
However, if that is indeed Godzilla,
and the last one,

00:26:30.083 --> 00:26:31.833
then there is only one option.

00:26:33.208 --> 00:26:34.667
Complete extermination.

00:26:35.083 --> 00:26:37.250
Are you utterly insane?

00:26:37.958 --> 00:26:43.500
As you are all aware,
we have drafted anti-Godzilla strategies.

00:26:45.208 --> 00:26:47.167
You mean that anonymous thesis?

00:26:47.250 --> 00:26:49.375
We don't even know who wrote it!

00:26:51.667 --> 00:26:54.125
It's from a specialist's investigation.

00:26:54.208 --> 00:26:56.708
It's deemed as promising information.

00:26:56.917 --> 00:27:03.625
I am also prepared to release the name
of the person who wrote it, right here.

00:27:04.708 --> 00:27:06.833
However, there are conditions.

00:27:07.083 --> 00:27:09.417
And what would those conditions be?

00:27:09.750 --> 00:27:14.208
To drop the charges regarding
the stolen secret information, and then...

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:17.208
release Captain Haruo Sakaki on bail.

00:27:17.875 --> 00:27:20.167
Captain Sakaki? It was him?

00:27:21.167 --> 00:27:23.417
You got us, Metphies.

00:27:25.917 --> 00:27:29.083
All shall be according to God's will.

00:27:43.000 --> 00:27:43.958
It's your turn.

00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:45.833
Haruo.

00:27:48.708 --> 00:27:52.958
It's here. This waveform is generating
the electromagnetic metamaterial.

00:27:53.667 --> 00:27:58.042
Since each of Godzilla's cells
can function as a powerful electromagnet,

00:27:58.500 --> 00:28:01.583
it emits a high-output,
high-frequency electromagnetic pulse

00:28:01.667 --> 00:28:04.583
and generates
an asymmetrically permeable shield.

00:28:04.833 --> 00:28:07.125
A physically impervious shield?

00:28:08.292 --> 00:28:11.583
It may be enormous,
but can a creature even do that?

00:28:11.917 --> 00:28:15.792
And if that were true,
how can we even begin to fight it?

00:28:16.333 --> 00:28:20.583
It's only for about 1/10,000 of a second,
but it emits a noise periodically.

00:28:20.667 --> 00:28:23.833
If we use an interference wave,
we can amplify that noise

00:28:23.917 --> 00:28:28.917
to fracture the metamaterial,
and we'll target that point.

00:28:29.417 --> 00:28:34.375
So by attacking a single point,
we can take that colossal thing down?

00:28:34.917 --> 00:28:38.417
There should be an organ
amplifying the electromagnetic pulse.

00:28:38.500 --> 00:28:41.458
If we destroy that,
we can neutralize the shield.

00:28:41.833 --> 00:28:43.000
And where is it?

00:28:43.458 --> 00:28:44.292
Unknown.

00:28:44.625 --> 00:28:47.667
There isn't enough data
in our visual records.

00:28:47.875 --> 00:28:52.125
We need to observe Godzilla
and analyze the emission pattern.

00:28:53.000 --> 00:28:55.292
As you know from past battles,

00:28:55.500 --> 00:28:59.125
we can confirm Godzilla has
tremendous regenerative abilities.

00:28:59.625 --> 00:29:04.500
The destroyed organs will regenerate, and
in the seconds before the shield goes up,

00:29:04.792 --> 00:29:09.042
we need to shove an EMP probe
into its body and destroy it from within.

00:29:09.458 --> 00:29:12.875
The main issue with this operation
is the changed atmosphere,

00:29:12.958 --> 00:29:15.708
and the electromagnetic wave interference.

00:29:16.292 --> 00:29:18.667
To observe and find Godzilla's weak point,

00:29:18.750 --> 00:29:21.667
we need detailed coordination
with accurate attacks,

00:29:21.958 --> 00:29:24.167
so close quarters combat is required.

00:29:24.458 --> 00:29:25.875
And for each process,

00:29:26.208 --> 00:29:29.083
we need manpower,
otherwise we cannot succeed.

00:29:29.375 --> 00:29:30.292
Preposterous!

00:29:30.833 --> 00:29:34.708
Even if we gather all the races,
there are only 4,000 of us.

00:29:35.125 --> 00:29:38.167
I cannot approve an operation
where lives can be lost.

00:29:38.750 --> 00:29:39.958
Captain Sakaki.

00:29:40.042 --> 00:29:41.792
I'll be blunt.

00:29:42.333 --> 00:29:46.750
In order for your operation to work,
how many people do you need?

00:29:47.417 --> 00:29:51.458
Combat engineers, infantry,
and special forces, so three battalions.

00:29:51.750 --> 00:29:54.208
If I form two companies from each,

00:29:54.292 --> 00:29:56.500
we're looking at about 600 people.

00:29:58.292 --> 00:29:59.667
Out of the question.

00:30:04.875 --> 00:30:08.125
Those who do not fight,
know not how to fight evil.

00:30:08.208 --> 00:30:12.417
Those gathered now, unified as one,
shall come to know God's mercy.

00:30:13.000 --> 00:30:17.167
Give praise to God.
All shall lead down the devoted path.

00:30:17.667 --> 00:30:21.833
Garbetrium guidance be with you all.

00:30:23.792 --> 00:30:27.958
<i>This is Colonel Elliot Leland,</i>
<i>commander of the Earth Landing Brigade.</i>

00:30:28.042 --> 00:30:30.333
<i>Everyone, continue your tasks and listen.</i>

00:30:31.792 --> 00:30:35.042
<i>All 600 gathered here</i>
<i>are the chosen elite forces</i>

00:30:35.125 --> 00:30:39.958
<i>who have decided to give their lives</i>
<i>to fight against Godzilla.</i>

00:30:41.333 --> 00:30:43.292
<i>Everyone correctly understands</i>

00:30:44.333 --> 00:30:49.333
<i>that there will be no constructive outlook</i>
<i>if you're trapped in an old society.</i>

00:30:50.125 --> 00:30:51.958
<i>Instead of a fake promised land,</i>

00:30:52.500 --> 00:30:54.625
we will take back our homeland,

00:30:55.333 --> 00:30:57.958
and promise prosperity
to the next generation.

00:30:58.917 --> 00:31:03.458
For the sake of humanity's future,
I look forward to everyone's efforts.

00:31:11.250 --> 00:31:14.208
All assembled landing ships
have exited the gates.

00:31:14.750 --> 00:31:17.583
Now closing the first launch gate station.

00:31:21.125 --> 00:31:25.250
That speech sounded like you wanted
to pick a fight with the Committee.

00:31:26.875 --> 00:31:27.708
Hey, Haruo.

00:31:28.583 --> 00:31:32.875
Didn't you also want to get
the Committee members frustrated?

00:31:33.792 --> 00:31:37.708
With the current system,
those members will just dry up and die.

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:40.875
There aren't any comfortable chairs
for us.

00:31:41.500 --> 00:31:45.208
But if we defeat Godzilla,
then the story will be different.

00:31:45.833 --> 00:31:47.750
A new hero will arrive.

00:31:48.583 --> 00:31:49.875
Our era will come.

00:31:51.167 --> 00:31:52.250
A hero, huh?

00:31:52.792 --> 00:31:54.875
You're just like when you were a kid.

00:31:56.375 --> 00:31:59.792
Don't take it the wrong way.
You're still on bail status.

00:32:00.333 --> 00:32:03.250
We went through a lot
just to get you back out.

00:32:03.333 --> 00:32:04.167
Commander.

00:32:04.542 --> 00:32:07.750
All landing ships have assembled
in low orbit.

00:32:09.500 --> 00:32:11.750
All ships, enter in sequential order.

00:32:11.833 --> 00:32:12.667
<i>Roger.</i>

00:32:13.250 --> 00:32:15.750
<i>All ships,</i>
<i>begin entry in sequential order.</i>

00:32:19.292 --> 00:32:21.125
Ship ten, ignite engine.

00:32:21.500 --> 00:32:23.958
Deploy anti-aerodynamic drag
and heat shield.

00:32:26.292 --> 00:32:27.583
You look unhappy.

00:32:27.875 --> 00:32:30.125
Even though your wish is being granted.

00:32:30.208 --> 00:32:33.292
I wonder if everything will go
according to plan.

00:32:33.958 --> 00:32:37.917
It'll be okay. As long as we have the hero
who will guide them.

00:32:39.083 --> 00:32:40.792
Are you a Leland sympathizer?

00:32:41.167 --> 00:32:45.125
Well, the one I put my hope in
is you,

00:32:45.833 --> 00:32:46.667
Haruo.

00:32:49.000 --> 00:32:52.708
The one true path to glory
can only be opened through devotion.

00:32:53.750 --> 00:32:56.208
This is our, the Exif's, creed.

00:32:57.167 --> 00:33:00.083
There are only a few Earthlings
who embody that.

00:33:00.750 --> 00:33:03.042
You're a rare exception.

00:33:04.292 --> 00:33:05.667
You overestimate me.

00:33:07.167 --> 00:33:10.250
You are the one who is worthy
of fighting Godzilla.

00:33:10.958 --> 00:33:14.250
The time will come soon enough
when that can be proven.

00:33:25.042 --> 00:33:26.458
Ship temperature stable.

00:33:28.625 --> 00:33:30.583
Passing the stratosphere.

00:33:30.833 --> 00:33:32.375
Altitude 30,000 meters.

00:33:32.792 --> 00:33:35.250
Igniting arc jet thrusters for cruising.

00:33:45.542 --> 00:33:49.583
Once we go under those clouds,
we won't see the sun anymore, huh?

00:33:49.792 --> 00:33:52.542
This planet has been
completely changed, too.

00:33:53.958 --> 00:33:55.667
Now entering the troposphere.

00:33:57.167 --> 00:34:01.083
Altitude 2,000. All ships,
begin navigating towards landing zone.

00:34:02.208 --> 00:34:03.833
The visibility's terrible.

00:34:04.250 --> 00:34:06.667
Switching the ship's probes to ultrasonic.

00:34:07.083 --> 00:34:08.458
Begin image processing.

00:34:09.917 --> 00:34:12.250
Company A, landing zone confirmed.

00:34:12.500 --> 00:34:13.833
Obstacles detected.

00:34:14.125 --> 00:34:18.042
As the reconnaissance drones reported,
this is a thick forest.

00:34:18.125 --> 00:34:21.875
Securing landing point now.
Prepare the thermobaric bombs.

00:34:21.958 --> 00:34:24.417
Roger. Dropping thermo-pressure warheads.

00:34:36.583 --> 00:34:38.458
They're being grandiose over there.

00:34:38.542 --> 00:34:41.667
Well, the special forces will land
on impeded terrain.

00:34:42.458 --> 00:34:43.292
What?

00:34:43.708 --> 00:34:46.417
An obstacle collided
with the ship's exterior.

00:34:46.958 --> 00:34:49.833
No issues so far with power and steering.

00:34:50.208 --> 00:34:51.500
An obstacle?

00:35:02.083 --> 00:35:05.333
Lieutenant Colonel Galu-gu,
Company E has also landed.

00:35:05.958 --> 00:35:08.792
We will now set
the combat engineers' traps.

00:35:08.875 --> 00:35:09.708
Okay.

00:35:12.042 --> 00:35:13.833
The old Tanzawa Pass, huh?

00:35:15.208 --> 00:35:17.667
If it was sunny,
it would've been beautiful.

00:35:18.542 --> 00:35:22.292
With this heavy fog,
a visual battle would be impossible.

00:35:24.208 --> 00:35:26.875
Lieutenant Colonel Galu-gu, please look.

00:35:26.958 --> 00:35:27.875
This is...

00:35:28.042 --> 00:35:30.708
Doesn't it look like
something scratched it?

00:35:31.375 --> 00:35:34.208
I hope the others are okay out there.

00:35:35.875 --> 00:35:37.792
Get the transmission balloons!

00:35:37.875 --> 00:35:40.583
You don't need to unload
the medical supplies.

00:35:49.958 --> 00:35:51.875
Transmission balloon reception favorable.

00:35:52.625 --> 00:35:57.250
Companies B and C special force units
will reach their destination on schedule.

00:35:57.875 --> 00:36:02.750
Companies D and E will deploy artillery
as the combat engineers lay down traps.

00:36:03.125 --> 00:36:06.583
Okay, the first battle formation
is going according to plan.

00:36:07.125 --> 00:36:11.542
Whichever company finds Godzilla first,
open fire with the special forces.

00:36:11.625 --> 00:36:13.542
Provoke it and divert its course.

00:36:13.875 --> 00:36:19.208
What's important is to observe Godzilla's
electromagnetic waves when it's attacked.

00:36:19.792 --> 00:36:24.667
We'll analyze this data to see which organ
emits the electromagnetic wave.

00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:29.333
Once we destroy that, we can neutralize
the asymmetrically permeable shield.

00:36:30.208 --> 00:36:34.167
And finally, we'll chase Godzilla
into this Tanzawa Pass,

00:36:34.292 --> 00:36:37.208
and slow it
with traps set by the engineers.

00:36:37.292 --> 00:36:40.667
The artillery unit will then open fire
from a close range.

00:36:40.875 --> 00:36:46.042
We'll amplify the pulse noise,
attack all at once, and destroy the organ.

00:36:46.875 --> 00:36:52.000
The shield will go down for a few seconds,
and then we'll use EMP probes to end it.

00:36:53.083 --> 00:36:57.167
If we can't find the amplifying organ,
we can't place the infantry.

00:36:57.458 --> 00:36:58.458
Exactly.

00:36:59.208 --> 00:37:03.417
The special forces analysis of the pattern
will influence the plan.

00:37:03.750 --> 00:37:08.500
So they'll spread out into a wide area,
and advance while analyzing the enemy.

00:37:09.292 --> 00:37:10.292
Cooperation is key.

00:37:10.792 --> 00:37:16.167
But who knew we'd have to rely
on something this pathetic to communicate?

00:37:17.208 --> 00:37:20.125
If we can transmit
through this convection cloud,

00:37:20.208 --> 00:37:24.458
the drones in the stratosphere will relay
our communication with no issues.

00:37:24.792 --> 00:37:28.500
But in this fog,
electronic communication will be limited.

00:37:28.917 --> 00:37:31.833
What is going on
with this planet's atmosphere?

00:37:32.125 --> 00:37:34.583
That's what we're trying to find out.

00:37:35.375 --> 00:37:38.208
Colonel, I'd like to form
an investigation team.

00:37:38.792 --> 00:37:41.125
If I can borrow three teams, as planned.

00:37:41.208 --> 00:37:44.875
The scouting team takes priority.
I'll give you two teams.

00:37:45.583 --> 00:37:46.583
All right, then.

00:37:46.667 --> 00:37:51.458
I'd like to go, too. I want to see with
my own eyes how this terrain has changed.

00:37:51.542 --> 00:37:52.708
You heard him.

00:37:53.042 --> 00:37:55.667
-Master Sergeant Yuko Tani, you're up.
-Yuko?

00:37:59.000 --> 00:38:04.167
You'll be his handler.
As you know, he's been released on bail.

00:38:04.708 --> 00:38:06.500
So be careful handling him.

00:38:06.875 --> 00:38:07.708
Understood.

00:38:27.250 --> 00:38:31.875
Unbelievable. Are these really the plants
growing on Earth?

00:38:32.417 --> 00:38:35.667
Is this what I saw in the ship's records?
Trees, was it?

00:38:35.958 --> 00:38:37.583
They look different, though.

00:38:53.167 --> 00:38:54.208
Don't touch it!

00:38:57.250 --> 00:38:59.583
In some places they're sharp as razors.

00:39:00.250 --> 00:39:03.458
It'd be deadly
if your airtight suit got a hole in it.

00:39:22.750 --> 00:39:25.250
Why did you request to join this mission?

00:39:25.708 --> 00:39:30.375
Because you're involved, Captain Sakaki,
and set up the operation.

00:39:30.958 --> 00:39:33.917
Please don't call me that.
Just Haruo is fine.

00:39:36.417 --> 00:39:40.458
I've always wanted to meet you
so we could speak in person.

00:39:41.417 --> 00:39:46.958
I wondered if it's because of you, Cap--
Haruo, that grandpa died at Tau-e.

00:39:47.250 --> 00:39:48.083
I...

00:39:48.417 --> 00:39:51.417
The bombs that you brought
inside the shuttle,

00:39:51.583 --> 00:39:56.167
I heard from security
that they were definitely all removed.

00:39:57.000 --> 00:39:58.917
But then the emigration group...

00:40:00.083 --> 00:40:01.875
Do you think it was an accident?

00:40:03.250 --> 00:40:05.083
You don't think it was?

00:40:06.292 --> 00:40:10.833
You said the Central Committee
wanted to reduce passengers.

00:40:11.583 --> 00:40:15.292
They could have used some trick
so the emigration group wouldn't--

00:40:15.375 --> 00:40:17.708
The Central Committee isn't that corrupt!

00:40:19.000 --> 00:40:23.125
That's what I want to think. I don't
want to be suspicious of my comrades.

00:40:23.708 --> 00:40:24.625
Haruo.

00:40:26.583 --> 00:40:31.167
No, that's not it. I couldn't forgive
myself for wanting to be suspicious.

00:40:31.458 --> 00:40:34.167
I don't want to be so judgmental
of humans.

00:40:34.625 --> 00:40:39.167
But being on that claustrophobic ship
and living on minimal supplies,

00:40:39.458 --> 00:40:42.000
it's normal for people
to become mistrustful.

00:40:43.667 --> 00:40:47.542
Godzilla didn't just steal Earth
away from us.

00:40:48.375 --> 00:40:52.000
Justice, faith, and the basic pride
we have as humans...

00:40:52.917 --> 00:40:54.875
we've come to lose them, too.

00:40:56.708 --> 00:41:00.167
And that's why
we need to fight Godzilla again.

00:41:01.625 --> 00:41:04.167
So we can take back the dignity we lost.

00:41:11.042 --> 00:41:11.875
This is...

00:41:12.333 --> 00:41:13.875
<i>Professor! Please come!</i>

00:41:15.625 --> 00:41:16.458
Over there!

00:41:22.500 --> 00:41:23.417
Ruins?

00:41:25.083 --> 00:41:28.417
But they couldn't have lasted
10,000 years.

00:41:29.792 --> 00:41:31.000
Captain Sakaki!

00:41:37.000 --> 00:41:37.833
I see.

00:41:39.208 --> 00:41:43.667
The lichen used the building's surface
as a seedbed and became fossilized.

00:41:44.083 --> 00:41:46.875
Afterwards,
the building materials weathered away,

00:41:46.958 --> 00:41:50.333
but the fossilized fungus
must have retained the shape.

00:41:51.375 --> 00:41:56.042
This is Earth's civilization.
People used to live here?

00:41:59.458 --> 00:42:00.458
Haruo?

00:42:01.833 --> 00:42:02.792
It remembered.

00:42:04.333 --> 00:42:11.250
Although we've forgotten,
this planet has always remembered us.

00:42:14.833 --> 00:42:19.125
Of course. Even after undergoing change,
this is still our Mother Earth.

00:42:20.000 --> 00:42:21.958
The planet that belongs to humans.

00:42:22.958 --> 00:42:25.792
We'll take it back... no matter what.

00:42:28.375 --> 00:42:29.500
With our own hands.

00:42:35.958 --> 00:42:39.125
Where's the scouting team?
Haven't they responded yet?

00:42:39.250 --> 00:42:41.500
It's probably the electromagnetic waves.

00:42:41.583 --> 00:42:43.708
The reception area
is five kilometers, right?

00:42:43.792 --> 00:42:44.625
Yes.

00:42:44.875 --> 00:42:47.375
Unexpected atmospheric changes
are also possible.

00:42:47.458 --> 00:42:50.417
There are reports of geomagnetic storms.

00:42:50.667 --> 00:42:54.083
But we're connected with
Martin's investigation team. It's strange!

00:43:04.000 --> 00:43:05.000
Hey, what's that?

00:43:05.083 --> 00:43:06.458
Is it the scouting team?

00:43:34.583 --> 00:43:35.417
What?

00:43:36.292 --> 00:43:37.792
Damn it! Kill it!

00:43:44.083 --> 00:43:46.208
-What?
-Something happened at the camp!

00:43:46.292 --> 00:43:48.458
-Professor Martin!
-Let's go back, now!

00:44:08.417 --> 00:44:12.750
This doesn't correspond to any
of Earth's primary species records.

00:44:13.500 --> 00:44:15.667
It must be a sudden variant,

00:44:15.958 --> 00:44:20.000
otherwise, how could something evolve
into a form like this?

00:44:21.250 --> 00:44:23.542
Would living organisms
go through such a change,

00:44:23.625 --> 00:44:26.083
even if 10,000 years have passed?

00:44:26.667 --> 00:44:29.083
We collected
and analyzed the forest's plants,

00:44:29.792 --> 00:44:33.458
and by using carbon dating,
I know how much time has passed.

00:44:33.833 --> 00:44:38.375
And it looks to be within a 50-year range
of 19,200 years.

00:44:38.917 --> 00:44:41.500
So our time away keeps increasing.

00:44:42.250 --> 00:44:46.958
The special cell characteristics of this
beast and the plants are interesting.

00:44:48.583 --> 00:44:49.917
Okay, it came off.

00:44:52.458 --> 00:44:57.083
The flora and fauna have differences,
but also similar, wide-ranging traits.

00:44:57.542 --> 00:45:00.625
Along with characteristics
very similar to metal,

00:45:00.708 --> 00:45:03.458
they have bodily functions
that exert powerful magnetism.

00:45:03.875 --> 00:45:05.125
The same as Godzilla?

00:45:05.208 --> 00:45:10.625
Yes. This beast is small, but it may be
in the same family as Godzilla.

00:45:11.250 --> 00:45:15.917
What's surprising is that the plants also
have strikingly similar characteristics.

00:45:16.000 --> 00:45:18.917
So this fog causing
the electromagnetic disturbance...

00:45:19.750 --> 00:45:23.500
The particles in the air
are the pollen of this forest's plants.

00:45:23.667 --> 00:45:26.417
It could also be their natural chaff.

00:45:26.667 --> 00:45:30.000
If the fog's caused by the organisms
and not the weather,

00:45:30.083 --> 00:45:34.333
we have to burn the entire forest down
to disperse this fog?

00:45:34.875 --> 00:45:38.875
So, we have no choice
but to abandon our first plan of waiting

00:45:39.375 --> 00:45:42.250
for the weather to clear up a bit
before we attack.

00:45:42.333 --> 00:45:43.542
That's not all.

00:45:43.792 --> 00:45:46.250
If dangerous beasts are wandering around,

00:45:46.333 --> 00:45:48.958
I have to split up our troops
for camp defense.

00:45:49.042 --> 00:45:52.333
We can reassign groups
to join the special forces.

00:45:52.417 --> 00:45:53.542
Don't be ridiculous!

00:45:54.083 --> 00:45:58.042
You want everyone to wander in
this unknown environment without a plan?

00:45:58.125 --> 00:45:59.542
Then what's your plan?

00:46:00.375 --> 00:46:01.208
Retreat.

00:46:02.542 --> 00:46:04.708
Logically, that's our only choice.

00:46:04.792 --> 00:46:06.083
What are you saying?

00:46:06.833 --> 00:46:10.458
The water and plants are toxic,
and the wild animals are hostile.

00:46:10.542 --> 00:46:13.708
The only benefits here
are air pressure and gravity.

00:46:14.167 --> 00:46:18.625
It'd be the height of stupidity
to fight Godzilla to reclaim this planet.

00:46:20.417 --> 00:46:23.042
This is our home!

00:46:23.917 --> 00:46:27.042
You're giving up?
Not only once, but twice?

00:46:28.125 --> 00:46:32.917
We can settle on the surface of the moon,
and collect resources from Earth.

00:46:33.042 --> 00:46:36.833
If we're thinking about safety,
it's a more realistic plan.

00:46:36.917 --> 00:46:41.375
Weren't you going to defeat Godzilla
and become a hero?

00:46:42.167 --> 00:46:46.167
I underestimated the situation.
My eyes are open now and I've learned!

00:46:46.250 --> 00:46:48.542
You're going to be a coward now?

00:46:49.458 --> 00:46:53.833
From wild beasts alone,
we have 12 dead and 35 critically injured!

00:46:53.917 --> 00:46:56.750
Without even seeing Godzilla,
this is the outcome!

00:46:56.875 --> 00:47:01.208
We can't play war with new soldiers
who've never fought in actual combat.

00:47:02.625 --> 00:47:03.542
Retreat?

00:47:04.500 --> 00:47:09.417
I do agree with the commander's decision,
but the problem is, how do we retreat?

00:47:10.500 --> 00:47:11.708
That attack just now

00:47:12.042 --> 00:47:15.792
left us with heavier equipment loss
than human casualties.

00:47:16.000 --> 00:47:16.833
Is that so?

00:47:17.958 --> 00:47:22.917
Frustratingly, those lizard things
destroyed four landing ships.

00:47:23.292 --> 00:47:28.667
Ship one and two's fuel systems and
ship three and four's engines are dead.

00:47:28.750 --> 00:47:32.542
We can't return to the mother ship
orbiting this planet anymore.

00:47:33.208 --> 00:47:36.625
If that's the case,
we need to gather Company A,

00:47:36.792 --> 00:47:42.042
and join the company with enough
transit power to get us all back to space.

00:47:43.125 --> 00:47:46.875
Companies B and C are special forces
like us, so they can't do it.

00:47:47.083 --> 00:47:51.125
So we must join the artillery unit
and the trap materials unit,

00:47:51.208 --> 00:47:53.667
which are Companies D and E.

00:47:54.625 --> 00:47:59.625
In order for us to escape
the wild animals' habitat,

00:48:00.250 --> 00:48:03.375
we must move through
this old Tanzawa Pass.

00:48:04.125 --> 00:48:09.167
And our first plan was to go through
the projected encounter area for Godzilla.

00:48:12.000 --> 00:48:13.375
That's correct.

00:48:14.250 --> 00:48:17.500
We need to pass the area
where Godzilla appears frequently.

00:48:17.833 --> 00:48:23.875
Of course, if we run into Godzilla,
that would be extremely awful for us.

00:48:24.375 --> 00:48:26.292
In order to secure safe passage...

00:48:27.292 --> 00:48:30.542
We would need backup
from Companies B and C.

00:48:31.042 --> 00:48:36.250
However, if we join up and form a cluster,
we'll be open to an atomic breath attack.

00:48:37.042 --> 00:48:38.750
What's the safest plan?

00:48:39.792 --> 00:48:41.375
While remaining spread out,

00:48:41.458 --> 00:48:46.667
repeatedly reciprocate the threat
and keep securing each other's safety.

00:48:47.042 --> 00:48:51.750
Yes. This is, however, quite close
to Captain Sakaki's original plan,

00:48:52.208 --> 00:48:54.875
with very few changes.

00:48:58.167 --> 00:49:01.875
Listen here.
This is a retreat tactic, no matter what.

00:49:02.292 --> 00:49:05.208
We will not take any action
to lure out Godzilla.

00:49:06.208 --> 00:49:10.583
Once all units reach the gathering point,
we complete the mission,

00:49:10.792 --> 00:49:12.542
and return to the mother ship.

00:49:13.792 --> 00:49:15.375
Be careful of that crack.

00:49:16.917 --> 00:49:18.792
Okay, that's good. This way!

00:49:19.167 --> 00:49:22.708
There's no fuse,
but it could still explode, so be careful.

00:49:23.208 --> 00:49:25.708
-That's a high explosive. Be careful.
-Yeah.

00:49:26.667 --> 00:49:30.292
<i>Company B, C, and all landing ships,</i>
<i>heading to Company D camp.</i>

00:49:30.375 --> 00:49:32.708
<i>-Confirm landing zone.</i>
<i>-Landing zone confirmed.</i>

00:49:32.792 --> 00:49:35.250
<i>All ships rotate bearing</i>
<i>to 202.5 degrees.</i>

00:49:35.333 --> 00:49:36.583
<i>-Marker lock.</i>
<i>-Roger.</i>

00:49:37.458 --> 00:49:39.083
So what's the situation?

00:49:39.167 --> 00:49:41.375
Company B, Company C reserves,

00:49:41.458 --> 00:49:46.375
and Company A hover squads
are to join with Company D and stand by.

00:49:46.875 --> 00:49:50.417
What's going on? Is the plan a go, or no?

00:49:50.958 --> 00:49:54.042
Based on Commander Leland's orders
to the hover squads,

00:49:54.125 --> 00:49:56.542
special forces
will abandon the base camps.

00:49:56.625 --> 00:50:00.375
After all units reach the final
gathering point, we'll retreat.

00:50:01.250 --> 00:50:05.042
We'll follow our original path,
but we won't search for Godzilla.

00:50:05.125 --> 00:50:11.125
So, what? Did we come down to Earth
just to display our marching orders?

00:50:11.500 --> 00:50:14.500
Company A's damage
must have been that severe.

00:50:14.917 --> 00:50:18.125
I heard there were
smaller Godzilla-like creatures.

00:50:18.333 --> 00:50:21.208
They were strong enough
to destroy a power suit.

00:50:21.542 --> 00:50:25.375
Leland, that coward. If he's going
to go along with Haruo's madness,

00:50:25.458 --> 00:50:28.208
he has to resign himself
from the beginning.

00:50:30.125 --> 00:50:32.792
They had us design this,

00:50:33.000 --> 00:50:36.542
and now we have to abandon it
because of overcapacity?

00:50:40.917 --> 00:50:43.792
Approaching Godzilla's
projected contact area.

00:50:44.042 --> 00:50:47.167
Hurry! We need to
get through this area quickly!

00:50:51.708 --> 00:50:54.167
Can't this thing pump out any more speed?

00:50:54.708 --> 00:50:57.500
By shifting parts around,
we got ship two moving.

00:50:58.208 --> 00:51:00.500
It's all we can do to keep it hovering.

00:51:00.958 --> 00:51:03.292
I guess I'm thankful that it's moving.

00:51:03.708 --> 00:51:06.583
I wouldn't want to walk through
this forest at all.

00:51:07.208 --> 00:51:09.375
Are you having foreboding thoughts?

00:51:10.208 --> 00:51:14.750
If this ends without us encountering
Godzilla, then why did I come here?

00:51:15.958 --> 00:51:18.083
Were you hoping to depend on luck?

00:51:18.667 --> 00:51:20.833
It's fine if we're actively searching,

00:51:20.917 --> 00:51:25.167
but if we pass by in a rush,
then we won't even find anything.

00:51:25.333 --> 00:51:30.417
That's if we were actively searching
for Godzilla, right?

00:51:31.625 --> 00:51:33.000
You and Colonel Leland

00:51:33.583 --> 00:51:36.917
still don't understand one crucial aspect
of that thing.

00:51:38.125 --> 00:51:40.542
It will never let humanity escape.

00:51:40.667 --> 00:51:44.542
Even more so if we've come to provoke it
without a trace of fear.

00:51:45.042 --> 00:51:47.167
So, it will be searching for us?

00:51:49.000 --> 00:51:51.958
Is that some divine message from god?

00:51:52.583 --> 00:51:53.458
It's a legend.

00:51:54.333 --> 00:51:58.542
We Exif have been wandering
through space as vagrants

00:51:58.625 --> 00:52:00.458
far longer than Earthlings have,

00:52:00.542 --> 00:52:03.417
and we've witnessed
many civilizations destroyed.

00:52:04.167 --> 00:52:10.333
Many have been regretfully destroyed
by creatures similar to Godzilla.

00:52:10.792 --> 00:52:11.625
What's that?

00:52:12.417 --> 00:52:15.667
He is the punishing iron hammer
for the arrogant.

00:52:16.458 --> 00:52:19.917
For the species who pronounce themselves
as lords of creation,

00:52:20.083 --> 00:52:22.542
a divine avenger will pay them a visit.

00:52:23.167 --> 00:52:24.250
And so, he will--

00:52:27.708 --> 00:52:28.750
What was that?

00:52:29.667 --> 00:52:30.583
An earthquake?

00:52:39.875 --> 00:52:42.667
Sound wave analysis!
All units, prepare for battle!

00:52:46.042 --> 00:52:49.042
Movement detected at two o'clock!
It's approaching!

00:52:58.292 --> 00:52:59.833
Evade! Evade, now!

00:53:09.167 --> 00:53:10.625
We can't evade in time!

00:53:26.625 --> 00:53:27.833
Run, Haruo.

00:53:29.333 --> 00:53:31.125
Do as your soul cries out to do.

00:53:31.875 --> 00:53:32.708
Yeah.

00:53:50.958 --> 00:53:53.500
The propellant is leaking!
It's going to explode!

00:54:20.000 --> 00:54:20.833
Hurry!

00:54:33.792 --> 00:54:35.375
I'll get you for this!

00:54:38.333 --> 00:54:39.292
That idiot.

00:54:39.958 --> 00:54:41.375
Haruo, why?

00:54:41.875 --> 00:54:45.792
He's going to record the moment
Godzilla activates its shield.

00:54:46.292 --> 00:54:48.750
And to do that, you have to attack it.

00:54:53.458 --> 00:54:57.250
Damn it, the electromagnetic sensor
isn't responding. Why?

00:54:59.833 --> 00:55:01.500
What are you doing? Let's go!

00:55:01.875 --> 00:55:03.417
But then, Captain Sakaki--

00:55:05.417 --> 00:55:06.708
Then, get out.

00:55:07.583 --> 00:55:10.625
Again! This time, at a closer distance!

00:55:13.792 --> 00:55:15.167
Damn it!

00:55:15.333 --> 00:55:16.167
I see.

00:55:16.625 --> 00:55:19.958
Such light damage
won't cause the shield to activate.

00:55:20.292 --> 00:55:21.333
Professor Martin!

00:55:22.083 --> 00:55:25.083
<i>Please record this next attack</i>
<i>with the sensor.</i>

00:55:25.417 --> 00:55:27.208
Captain! What's your plan?

00:55:27.292 --> 00:55:30.417
<i>I'm going to nose-dive</i>
<i>and slam into it.</i>

00:55:30.958 --> 00:55:31.792
What?

00:55:38.167 --> 00:55:41.000
You bastard, I will...

00:55:52.792 --> 00:55:53.833
What?

00:56:12.208 --> 00:56:14.125
This planet can go to hell.

00:56:26.375 --> 00:56:27.208
Leland.

00:56:52.250 --> 00:56:54.000
Colonel Leland was killed?

00:56:54.292 --> 00:56:59.250
<i>Yes. According to rank,</i>
<i>the command will now fall to me, though...</i>

00:56:59.750 --> 00:57:00.583
Can you do it?

00:57:00.917 --> 00:57:05.792
<i>I'll need to reassign a subordinate</i>
<i>who has disobeyed military regulations.</i>

00:57:05.875 --> 00:57:08.375
<i>This is an emergency,</i>
<i>so please understand.</i>

00:57:09.042 --> 00:57:12.750
For this occasion, fine.
Bring back as many people as you can.

00:57:13.208 --> 00:57:14.208
<i>Understood.</i>

00:57:18.083 --> 00:57:20.375
Did you analyze the data sent to us?

00:57:20.458 --> 00:57:21.583
Finished just now.

00:57:22.208 --> 00:57:24.833
The electromagnetic metamaterial's
output has been recorded.

00:57:25.208 --> 00:57:28.000
Just as you surmised, a shield exists.

00:57:28.750 --> 00:57:30.958
The noise in question was confirmed.

00:57:31.542 --> 00:57:33.500
It's not unified across its body.

00:57:33.583 --> 00:57:35.667
There's clearly a concentrated spot.

00:57:35.750 --> 00:57:36.667
The dorsal fin?

00:57:37.125 --> 00:57:41.792
This is where the shield is generated.
Leland gave his life for this information.

00:57:44.083 --> 00:57:49.417
Everyone, during that earlier encounter,
Colonel Leland died an honorable death.

00:57:50.542 --> 00:57:54.208
And so,
as the Central Committee's direct priest,

00:57:54.542 --> 00:57:57.458
I have accepted full responsibility
for this operation.

00:57:58.417 --> 00:58:02.750
However, I cannot say that I am
the best man for this job.

00:58:04.208 --> 00:58:08.667
All people are born to accomplish the task
they were meant to do.

00:58:09.833 --> 00:58:12.458
This has been established
in our scriptures,

00:58:12.833 --> 00:58:17.625
and as I shoulder the burden of a priest,
I cannot turn my back to this truth.

00:58:18.583 --> 00:58:22.583
With the premise
of taking full responsibility,

00:58:23.208 --> 00:58:25.750
I will now entrust all decision-making...

00:58:27.958 --> 00:58:30.167
to Captain Sakaki, as the commander.

00:58:31.875 --> 00:58:33.958
Okay, Haruo.

00:58:35.042 --> 00:58:35.875
Your orders.

00:58:36.167 --> 00:58:37.250
But that's insane!

00:58:49.583 --> 00:58:52.750
The situation is dire,
so I'll skip the pleasantries.

00:58:53.625 --> 00:58:57.625
I don't have an outlook
for humanity's future,

00:58:58.083 --> 00:59:02.875
and I don't have enough of a strategy
to estimate our chances of winning.

00:59:03.792 --> 00:59:05.792
However, I can say this.

00:59:07.083 --> 00:59:11.208
Those who didn't yield to Godzilla
can proudly welcome another day.

00:59:12.333 --> 00:59:15.375
This is not only a battle
to kill Godzilla.

00:59:16.708 --> 00:59:19.917
What we are about to fight
is a humiliating future

00:59:20.375 --> 00:59:23.667
with no choice
but to accept despair and resignation.

00:59:24.958 --> 00:59:31.542
If we can reject and fight that,
we can once again dream of hope and pride.

00:59:32.500 --> 00:59:35.833
Just as our ancestors did,
who thrived here before us.

00:59:36.583 --> 00:59:40.167
That's right. If we don't retreat now,
if we don't show fear,

00:59:40.417 --> 00:59:44.000
and if we put our lives on the line,
we've already won.

00:59:44.625 --> 00:59:46.625
All we need to do is finish it.

00:59:47.708 --> 00:59:51.875
Humanity's 22-year-long nightmare,
and Godzilla's 20,000-year era.

00:59:54.792 --> 00:59:58.083
I look forward to your brave efforts.
That is all.

01:00:09.792 --> 01:00:11.375
We'll begin our operation.

01:00:11.458 --> 01:00:14.083
Yuko, you know Godzilla's position, right?

01:00:14.375 --> 01:00:17.375
Yes.
It's about 80 kilometers north-north-east.

01:00:17.458 --> 01:00:20.083
Moving southwest
at 40 kilometers an hour.

01:00:20.167 --> 01:00:23.875
Set up transmission balloons
every 3,000 meters on the battlefield.

01:00:24.458 --> 01:00:26.792
-We need optimal communicative reception.
-Roger.

01:00:26.875 --> 01:00:30.875
Major Belu-be, provoke Godzilla
from a distance and watch its reaction.

01:00:30.958 --> 01:00:32.542
Maintain that distance.

01:00:32.792 --> 01:00:34.125
Sure, leave it to me.

01:00:34.542 --> 01:00:36.458
Adam, watch for the atomic breath.

01:00:36.625 --> 01:00:38.875
If electric potential rises,
escape immediately.

01:00:39.000 --> 01:00:39.833
Understood.

01:00:40.375 --> 01:00:41.208
Galu-gu.

01:00:41.333 --> 01:00:45.292
I'll move to the trap point
and command the power suit team directly.

01:00:45.542 --> 01:00:46.375
What?

01:00:47.208 --> 01:00:50.833
I'll determine the EMP probes'
target point on-site.

01:00:51.375 --> 01:00:52.458
However...

01:00:52.875 --> 01:00:55.083
Galu-gu, how are the trap placements?

01:00:55.167 --> 01:00:56.792
All according to plan.

01:00:56.875 --> 01:00:59.333
Its weak point is the dorsal fin,
its back.

01:00:59.458 --> 01:01:02.708
Since we need to concentrate our fire
at a close distance,

01:01:02.792 --> 01:01:07.833
we have to let it pass the line of fire,
and lure it deeper into the valley.

01:01:08.458 --> 01:01:10.208
So we only have one chance.

01:01:10.333 --> 01:01:14.667
To make this plan work, we need
to place the traps deeper in the valley.

01:01:25.250 --> 01:01:27.417
Artillery units are all in position.

01:01:27.792 --> 01:01:28.625
We're ready.

01:01:29.000 --> 01:01:31.750
Can we really lure it
all the way out here?

01:01:31.833 --> 01:01:34.625
We have no choice but to believe in them.

01:01:37.833 --> 01:01:41.333
Power suit team, move to the trap point.
We'll stand by.

01:01:43.250 --> 01:01:45.833
I'm leaving the diversion to you, Belu-be.

01:01:46.375 --> 01:01:47.208
Roger.

01:01:49.625 --> 01:01:53.250
All squads, ascend to planned altitude.
Cross-delta pattern formation.

01:02:04.792 --> 01:02:07.000
Godzilla detected
at the projected contact area.

01:02:07.792 --> 01:02:10.208
All units, commence the diversion plan.

01:02:10.333 --> 01:02:12.083
Right wing, squad one, attack!

01:02:15.208 --> 01:02:16.917
Godzilla sighting confirmed!

01:02:17.125 --> 01:02:17.958
Fire!

01:02:20.917 --> 01:02:21.875
All units, turn!

01:02:31.583 --> 01:02:35.250
Ascend in battle formation.
We'll attack as long as possible!

01:02:43.792 --> 01:02:45.583
Target successfully diverted.

01:02:45.958 --> 01:02:47.167
We can do this!

01:02:51.250 --> 01:02:52.083
Evade!

01:02:57.250 --> 01:03:00.000
Damn it! Adam! Take the left wing!

01:03:00.167 --> 01:03:01.792
Roger, left wing, squad one.

01:03:01.875 --> 01:03:04.833
-The impact area is bigger!
-It's hard to evade!

01:03:04.917 --> 01:03:08.333
The evading maneuvers
are just a second delayed. Let's go!

01:03:17.917 --> 01:03:20.917
-Right wing, squad two, follow and attack!
-Roger!

01:03:34.083 --> 01:03:36.083
These guys aren't part of the plan!

01:03:36.625 --> 01:03:37.458
What's wrong?

01:03:37.542 --> 01:03:39.917
<i>Major Belu-be!</i>
<i>It's what attacked Company A!</i>

01:03:40.625 --> 01:03:44.208
What? All squads provide cover fire
from a higher altitude.

01:03:44.583 --> 01:03:47.542
Shoot them down
before more come from the forest!

01:03:51.750 --> 01:03:53.792
Left wing, squad two, counterattack!

01:04:06.667 --> 01:04:08.625
We have no time for the small fish.

01:04:08.958 --> 01:04:11.625
Left wing, squad two,
continue the diversion!

01:04:22.833 --> 01:04:24.250
<i>Belu-be, are you okay?</i>

01:04:24.500 --> 01:04:26.292
It seems like you're in trouble.

01:04:26.375 --> 01:04:30.625
<i>Like the simulations predicted,</i>
<i>we should be able to lure it to the spot.</i>

01:04:30.708 --> 01:04:32.167
<i>But we need more firepower.</i>

01:04:32.250 --> 01:04:35.125
It'll be night soon.
Can you hasten the process?

01:04:35.375 --> 01:04:38.625
<i>Ten have gone down.</i>
<i>Ammo and gas are almost depleted.</i>

01:04:39.083 --> 01:04:40.375
Adam. Do you copy?

01:04:41.167 --> 01:04:43.042
Yes. Captain, I copy.

01:04:43.542 --> 01:04:45.958
<i>-I'm reassigning you.</i>
-What, right now?

01:04:46.042 --> 01:04:49.000
I'm shortening the time allotted
to lure Godzilla.

01:04:49.083 --> 01:04:51.208
What? How can we do that?

01:04:51.875 --> 01:04:55.458
<i>I'll use the landing ships</i>
<i>for a bombardment to create a path.</i>

01:04:55.542 --> 01:04:58.125
What? Send the landing ships
to the frontline?

01:04:58.250 --> 01:04:59.375
It's too dangerous.

01:04:59.500 --> 01:05:02.917
If they get shot down,
how will we return to the mother ship?

01:05:03.292 --> 01:05:04.917
But we're already home.

01:05:05.750 --> 01:05:09.792
There's nowhere else to return to
but here. Isn't that right?

01:05:10.625 --> 01:05:12.167
Have you lost your mind?

01:05:12.500 --> 01:05:13.375
Let's do it.

01:05:13.708 --> 01:05:16.542
It'll be useless
to prepare an escape route.

01:05:17.042 --> 01:05:19.792
In order to win,
we need to play every hand.

01:05:20.542 --> 01:05:23.833
This is why belligerent species
are difficult to deal with.

01:05:24.208 --> 01:05:28.875
Adam, select five elite pilots.
Prepare the landing ships for takeoff.

01:05:29.208 --> 01:05:30.125
Roger.

01:05:30.208 --> 01:05:33.792
Major Belu-be, Second Lieutenant
Adam Bindewald, withdrawing!

01:05:34.208 --> 01:05:36.958
Hurry and go! We'll handle this somehow!

01:05:37.917 --> 01:05:40.042
Right wing, squad one, charge again!

01:05:43.292 --> 01:05:44.917
Don't fall behind!

01:05:57.417 --> 01:05:59.583
Six elite pilots, standing by!

01:06:00.125 --> 01:06:01.333
We can go anytime!

01:06:01.417 --> 01:06:03.667
<i>Load all ammunition, even the reserves.</i>

01:06:03.750 --> 01:06:05.167
If we mess up, that's it.

01:06:05.458 --> 01:06:06.292
Roger!

01:06:06.708 --> 01:06:08.375
All landing ships, depart!

01:06:09.042 --> 01:06:13.083
Starting from Godzilla's position,
create a path until the signal is given.

01:06:13.958 --> 01:06:15.667
Fire at will, if you must.

01:06:15.792 --> 01:06:18.250
Eliminate any obstacles in its way.

01:06:19.625 --> 01:06:21.292
Commencing final diversion.

01:06:21.875 --> 01:06:25.083
This is the point of no return.
We'll end this, now.

01:06:26.125 --> 01:06:30.375
Listen up, the landing ships' mobility
can't evade an attack in time.

01:06:30.458 --> 01:06:33.167
Once you know you're targeted,
abandon ship!

01:06:33.458 --> 01:06:35.250
Captain, you're being lavish!

01:06:35.875 --> 01:06:39.708
Hover squads, save ammo until
the route is open. Minimize losses.

01:06:40.167 --> 01:06:43.833
Roger. We're almost out of gas.
So there's no second chances!

01:06:45.958 --> 01:06:46.792
Turn!

01:06:54.542 --> 01:06:56.583
The landing ships are almost here!

01:06:56.667 --> 01:06:59.000
Spread out to avoid the bombardment!

01:07:01.375 --> 01:07:05.333
All ships, drop the thermobaric bombs!
Scatter all that you have!

01:07:15.792 --> 01:07:18.417
All landing ships, disperse! Spread out!

01:07:23.000 --> 01:07:24.875
So who drew the short straw?

01:07:27.333 --> 01:07:28.250
It's me, huh?

01:07:43.708 --> 01:07:46.125
Okay! Godzilla is on the diversion path!

01:07:46.375 --> 01:07:50.083
Now! All hover squads,
fire everything you have! This is it!

01:07:50.333 --> 01:07:54.292
Roger! All squads, resume the diversion!
Increase attack frequency!

01:08:00.708 --> 01:08:01.542
Damn it!

01:08:03.333 --> 01:08:05.458
It's no good! I can't speed up!

01:08:08.792 --> 01:08:11.667
All squads! Join the left wing!
Just a little more!

01:08:14.083 --> 01:08:15.500
<i>Diversion is in progress.</i>

01:08:15.583 --> 01:08:18.500
<i>Godzilla is accelerating</i>
<i>toward the trap point!</i>

01:08:18.583 --> 01:08:20.458
<i>Haruo, please hurry and board.</i>

01:08:20.542 --> 01:08:21.417
Yuko!

01:08:21.500 --> 01:08:22.542
<i>Why are you here?</i>

01:08:23.083 --> 01:08:25.375
I've always been on the power suit team.

01:08:25.458 --> 01:08:28.667
<i>Do you understand?</i>
<i>This is practically a suicide mission!</i>

01:08:29.208 --> 01:08:30.792
I want to become stronger!

01:08:32.167 --> 01:08:34.958
That's what I thought when Grandpa died.

01:08:36.042 --> 01:08:39.792
<i>Godzilla entering Tanzawa Pass.</i>
<i>Only 500 meters to the trap point.</i>

01:08:53.458 --> 01:08:55.792
Damn it, I'm running out of gas!

01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:58.958
Keep provoking it
and lure it to the last point.

01:08:59.500 --> 01:09:02.292
Stay calm, this is the critical moment.

01:09:02.583 --> 01:09:04.708
<i>Trap point arrival, 100 meters!</i>

01:09:08.417 --> 01:09:11.667
You will return Earth to humans.

01:09:12.542 --> 01:09:13.958
Fifty more meters!

01:09:14.833 --> 01:09:17.125
Damn, I can't stand this.

01:09:17.500 --> 01:09:21.792
At times like this, I'm jealous of those
who have a god to pray to.

01:09:29.333 --> 01:09:30.500
All units, disperse!

01:09:32.625 --> 01:09:33.625
<i>Ten meters!</i>

01:09:37.083 --> 01:09:38.792
<i>Godzilla is at the trap point!</i>

01:09:39.708 --> 01:09:40.792
Set off the trap!

01:09:50.250 --> 01:09:51.625
<i>Trap detonation complete!</i>

01:09:56.125 --> 01:09:58.792
Godzilla's movement stopped.

01:09:59.917 --> 01:10:01.792
Did we succeed in capturing it?

01:10:09.125 --> 01:10:11.958
Artillery unit, begin concentrated fire!

01:10:23.250 --> 01:10:25.333
Asymmetrically permeable shield,
generated!

01:10:25.750 --> 01:10:27.417
All gun ports, synchronized attack!

01:10:27.875 --> 01:10:30.625
Body surface electromagnetic pulse
alignment sync at 75%!

01:10:31.125 --> 01:10:33.833
At 75%? Is the pattern changing?

01:10:34.250 --> 01:10:37.708
Alignment incomplete.
Unable to predict shield collapse!

01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:40.583
Damn it, we can't attack like this.

01:10:40.917 --> 01:10:42.625
Search for the noise. Hurry!

01:10:42.958 --> 01:10:46.875
Noise detected.
The next shield collapse is in 20 seconds.

01:10:47.375 --> 01:10:48.333
Twenty seconds?

01:10:48.708 --> 01:10:50.125
Will the restraints hold?

01:10:57.167 --> 01:10:58.167
Sync at 100%.

01:10:58.625 --> 01:11:02.542
Detecting resonance with noise wave!
Shield collapse in ten seconds!

01:11:09.792 --> 01:11:11.875
Artillery unit, fire!

01:11:15.250 --> 01:11:17.292
If we can destroy the dorsal fin...

01:11:19.083 --> 01:11:20.708
The shield is dropping!

01:11:21.292 --> 01:11:23.458
Electric potential rising!
It's an atomic breath!

01:11:25.958 --> 01:11:27.083
It can still attack?

01:11:28.792 --> 01:11:31.625
The tissue on Godzilla's back
is regenerating!

01:11:31.958 --> 01:11:33.875
The shield will be restored.

01:11:34.375 --> 01:11:36.667
Shield will be up in about 200 seconds!

01:11:36.958 --> 01:11:39.208
The restraints are no longer holding!

01:11:40.083 --> 01:11:40.917
Damn it.

01:11:41.667 --> 01:11:42.667
I'll finish this!

01:11:44.333 --> 01:11:45.458
Haruo!

01:11:51.167 --> 01:11:54.125
-What is he--
-With a close-range EMP attack,

01:11:54.208 --> 01:11:56.250
he'll disrupt the noise pattern.

01:12:00.583 --> 01:12:03.167
The pulse is changing. It's syncing again!

01:12:03.875 --> 01:12:06.333
The next shield collapse
is in ten seconds!

01:12:06.500 --> 01:12:09.792
Don't worry about me!
Destroy the rest of the dorsal fin!

01:12:10.083 --> 01:12:11.208
But then you'll...

01:12:11.750 --> 01:12:13.500
<i>Doesn't matter! Fire!</i>

01:12:14.292 --> 01:12:16.125
The shield is now collapsing!

01:12:18.875 --> 01:12:21.208
Fire! Fire until the gun barrel burns up!

01:12:25.667 --> 01:12:27.250
The shield is dropping!

01:12:27.625 --> 01:12:29.417
Okay, power suit unit, attack!

01:12:44.125 --> 01:12:46.375
The EMP probes are entering its body!

01:12:52.750 --> 01:12:55.708
All units, retreat! Retreat!

01:13:06.625 --> 01:13:08.958
Electromagnetic concentration
in the air, rising!

01:13:10.417 --> 01:13:12.292
It didn't work?

01:13:12.708 --> 01:13:16.417
It did, the electromagnetic waves
are running wild inside it.

01:13:27.167 --> 01:13:28.833
You bastard, I have...

01:13:31.458 --> 01:13:33.750
killed you!

01:13:49.667 --> 01:13:51.958
He really did it.

01:14:51.083 --> 01:14:51.917
Haruo!

01:15:05.917 --> 01:15:08.000
Look at this.

01:15:10.708 --> 01:15:12.208
This body structure...

01:15:13.750 --> 01:15:16.333
Yeah. Indeed a monster.

01:15:18.500 --> 01:15:20.542
You've accomplished it, Captain.

01:15:21.250 --> 01:15:24.250
Because everyone believed in
and supported me,

01:15:24.500 --> 01:15:26.750
I could be so daring and get this far.

01:15:27.917 --> 01:15:32.792
Even though we defeated it...
What was it, really?

01:15:33.375 --> 01:15:36.042
How was it able to live for 20,000 years?

01:15:37.625 --> 01:15:39.042
This is just my opinion,

01:15:39.583 --> 01:15:44.208
but I think this is a different Godzilla
than the one that drove us from Earth.

01:15:45.375 --> 01:15:49.625
But its appearance and abilities
were almost identical.

01:15:49.708 --> 01:15:53.375
And that's exactly why.
Life's true nature is found in change.

01:15:53.875 --> 01:15:57.083
No matter how gradual
the renewal cycle may be,

01:15:57.375 --> 01:16:00.792
it's impossible to maintain
the exact same appearance.

01:16:01.292 --> 01:16:05.750
So this one may be an offspring
that inherited Godzilla's form and nature.

01:16:05.958 --> 01:16:08.875
Such a guess would actually
be the most natural.

01:16:09.500 --> 01:16:14.167
Although the question remains
of why there was only this one. Also--

01:16:14.250 --> 01:16:18.375
So, there's no guarantee
only one of them survived.

01:16:18.833 --> 01:16:22.833
I apologize if what I'm saying
spoils the victory, but that is correct.

01:16:23.708 --> 01:16:28.792
That's fine. Thanks to this battle,
we proved that we can defeat Godzilla.

01:16:29.375 --> 01:16:32.708
Even if another one shows up,
we have nothing to fear.

01:16:33.667 --> 01:16:38.208
Since we've established a valid strategy,
we can be more effective next time.

01:16:38.500 --> 01:16:43.083
Personally, I would never want to cross
a tightrope like that ever again, though.

01:16:46.250 --> 01:16:47.083
What was that?

01:16:48.125 --> 01:16:50.125
Did anyone measure the vibration?

01:16:50.208 --> 01:16:52.167
I'm picking it up on this sensor!

01:16:53.750 --> 01:16:56.042
Find the origin using Gematoria analysis.

01:16:56.125 --> 01:16:56.958
Yes, sir.

01:16:57.583 --> 01:17:01.500
No, it can't be. Is the meter damaged?

01:17:01.750 --> 01:17:04.458
-What is it?
-It's within two kilometers?

01:17:04.542 --> 01:17:05.583
It's nearby!

01:17:05.708 --> 01:17:06.833
That's ridiculous!

01:17:06.917 --> 01:17:09.875
Electric potential, rising.
The numbers are unbelievable!

01:17:09.958 --> 01:17:12.125
They are far greater than Godzilla's!

01:17:12.208 --> 01:17:13.750
Underground heat source...

01:17:13.958 --> 01:17:17.042
Wait, a plasma reaction? This can't be!

01:17:50.208 --> 01:17:51.375
What's happening?

01:18:05.958 --> 01:18:06.792
Is that...

01:18:12.708 --> 01:18:13.708
Wh-What is that?

01:18:14.250 --> 01:18:15.083
Godzilla?

01:18:15.333 --> 01:18:17.833
Height over 300 meters and rising.

01:18:18.500 --> 01:18:22.375
Surface vibroscope estimates a mass
of about 100,000 tons.

01:18:24.958 --> 01:18:26.958
This is impossible!

01:18:43.750 --> 01:18:46.750
Can that be a living creature?
Unbelievable!

01:18:47.167 --> 01:18:51.417
No, according to the rules
for living creatures, this is correct.

01:18:52.042 --> 01:18:52.875
Professor?

01:18:52.958 --> 01:18:57.958
Indeed, the changing form of life
isn't just about decay.

01:18:58.917 --> 01:19:05.000
If it continued its life activity
for 20,000 years, growing earnestly...

01:19:06.375 --> 01:19:09.042
When those fleeting lives destined to die,

01:19:09.125 --> 01:19:12.042
forget their humbleness
and sing praises of their glory,

01:19:12.458 --> 01:19:15.625
such will shake the very heavens
and split the earth,

01:19:15.708 --> 01:19:18.167
and they shall know the wrath
of the divine.

01:19:18.250 --> 01:19:20.833
The inevitable incarnation of destruction.

01:19:24.250 --> 01:19:26.042
So, you show yourself at last.

01:19:26.625 --> 01:19:31.250
Since we last saw each other, it has been
20 years for us and 20,000 years for you.

01:19:33.542 --> 01:19:34.958
It's been a while...

01:19:36.125 --> 01:19:37.667
Oh, King of Destruction.

01:19:46.333 --> 01:19:49.750
All landing ships, take off immediately!
Emergency retreat!

01:19:50.083 --> 01:19:51.792
But we're still withdrawing!

01:19:51.875 --> 01:19:55.625
Just take whoever's already onboard
before that thing attacks us!

01:19:58.000 --> 01:20:01.667
Everyone, do whatever it takes
to get far away from here! Hurry!

01:20:41.667 --> 01:20:44.042
What's that? A super oscillatory wave?

01:20:44.125 --> 01:20:48.375
Estimated electric output
is measuring over 900 gigawatts.

01:20:48.750 --> 01:20:49.583
Damn it!

01:20:50.208 --> 01:20:51.667
What do you intend to do?

01:20:52.500 --> 01:20:54.042
I'll divert its attention!

01:20:54.208 --> 01:20:56.292
I'll buy time so people can run!

01:20:56.375 --> 01:20:58.583
You don't think that'll work, do you?

01:22:09.208 --> 01:22:13.833
You bastard... I will...
